      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Heat dissipation is improved in nonlinear III-V photonic crystal waveguides owing to the hybrid III-V/Silicon integration platform, allowing efficient four-wave mixing in the continuous-wave regime. A conversion efficiency of -17.6\u2009\u2009dB is demonstrated with a pump power level below 100 mW in a dispersion-engineered waveguide with a flat group index of 28 over a 10 nm bandwidth."},
